#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "Seconds an open circuit waits before a half-open probe"
msgstr "熔断器打开后，等待多少秒才做一次半开探测"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "`CIRCUIT_COOLDOWN_SECONDS`"
msgstr ""

