"在当前 commit 上，`GET /routing` 和 `GET /admin/routing` 没有挂任何认证依赖。两者都会返回每条路由的 "
"provider 标签、**上游 base URL** 和流量权重；`/admin/routing` "
"还额外包含未发布的路由。如果你的网关能从公网访问，除非你有意公开自己的上游拓扑，否则请在反向代理上封掉这两个路径。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:417
msgid ""
"`/v1/models` shape-shifts by client: an Anthropic-family client calling "
"it receives the Anthropic list response, while `/models` and "
"`/openrouter/models` always return the OpenAI/OpenRouter shape."
msgstr ""
"`/v1/models` 会随客户端变形：Anthropic 系的客户端调用它，会拿到 Anthropic 的列表响应；而 `/models` 和"
" `/openrouter/models` 始终返回 OpenAI/OpenRouter 的形状。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:421
msgid "Deployment shape"
msgstr "部署形态"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:423
msgid ""
"The repository ships Dockerfiles and Compose files under "
"`deploy/docker/`: `Dockerfile.backend` (the gateway), "
"`Dockerfile.frontend` (the Next.js console in `apps/frontend/`), "
"`Dockerfile.rocm` (an AMD GPU variant), and `docker-compose.yml`. Systemd"
" units live in `deploy/systemd/`."
msgstr ""
"仓库在 `deploy/docker/` 下提供 Dockerfile 和 Compose "
"文件：`Dockerfile.backend`（网关）、`Dockerfile.frontend`（`apps/frontend/` 里的 "
"Next.js 控制台）、`Dockerfile.rocm`（AMD GPU 变体）和 `docker-compose.yml`。systemd "
"单元在 `deploy/systemd/`。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:428
msgid ""
"The console and the API share one origin: the Next.js rewrites in "
"`apps/frontend/next.config.js` proxy `/v1`, `/anthropic`, `/auth`, "
"`/user`, `/admin`, `/health`, and `/site-config` to the backend, so a "
"browser session and an API key reach the same paths on the same host. "
"Those rewrites — not a reverse proxy config — are the public path table; "
"see [Edge and console routing](edge-and-console-routing.md). The frontend"
" has its own toolchain and quality gates, separate from the Python `make`"
" targets."
msgstr ""
"控制台和 API 共享同一个 origin：`apps/frontend/next.config.js` 里的 Next.js rewrites "
"把 `/v1`、`/anthropic`、`/auth`、`/user`、`/admin`、`/health` 和 `/site-config` "
"代理到后端，因此浏览器会话和 API key 访问的是同一台主机上的同一批路径。这些 "
"rewrites——而不是某份反向代理配置——才是公开的路径表；见[边缘与控制台路由](edge-and-console-"
"routing.md)。前端有自己的工具链和质量门禁，与 Python 的 `make` 目标相互独立。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:436
msgid ""
"See [Deployment Guide](deployment.md) to run it, "
"[Installation](installation.md) for a local checkout, and "
"[Contributing](contributing.md) before sending a change."
msgstr ""
"运行它见[部署指南](deployment.md)，本地检出见[安装](installation.md)，提交改动前先看[参与贡献](contributing.md)。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:439
msgid "Design principles"
msgstr "设计原则"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:441
msgid ""
"**One model id, many endpoints.** Clients name a model; the gateway owns "
"which machine serves it. Everything else follows from that."
msgstr "**一个模型 id，多个端点**。客户端点名一个模型；由网关掌握哪台机器来服务它。其余的一切都由此推导而来。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:443
msgid ""
"**Failure is routed around, not retried into.** A non-idempotent "
"generation is never re-sent to the same endpoint; resilience comes from "
"the fallback chain and the circuit breaker."
msgstr "**故障是被绕过去的，不是往里重试的**。非幂等的生成绝不会重发到同一个端点；韧性来自回退链和熔断器。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:446
msgid ""
"**A caller learns nothing it is not entitled to.** Access failures "
"collapse to a uniform `404`, and upstream errors are scrubbed before they"
" reach a client."
msgstr "**调用方不会知道任何它无权知道的东西**。访问失败一律收敛成统一的 `404`，上游错误在到达客户端之前会被清洗。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:449
msgid ""
"**Configuration is a deployment's, not the project's.** The repository "
"ships runnable examples; a real deployment supplies its own registry and "
"routing files through the resolution chain above."
msgstr "**配置属于部署，不属于项目**。仓库提供可运行的示例；真实的部署通过上面那条解析链提供自己的注册表和路由文件。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:452
msgid ""
"**Extension points are declarative.** New provider: a `kind` and, if the "
"API is not OpenAI-compatible, an adapter. New routing behaviour: a module"
" in `apps/backend/routing/strategies/` that self-registers. Neither "
"requires touching the request handler."
msgstr ""
"**扩展点是声明式的**。新 provider：一个 `kind`；如果它的 API 不是 OpenAI 兼容的，再加一个 "
"adapter。新的路由行为：在 `apps/backend/routing/strategies/` "
"下放一个自注册的模块。两者都不需要动请求处理器。"

